{"text":"The knowledge that you have emerged wiser and stronger from setbacks means that you are, ever after, secure in your ability to survive. You will never truly know yourself or the strength of your relationships until both have been tested by adversity. Such knowledge is a true gift for all that it is painfully won, and it has been worth more than any qualification I ever earned. So, given a time, Turner, I would tell my 21-year-old self that personal happiness lies in knowing that life is not a checklist of acquisition or achievement. Your qualifications, your CV, are not your life, though you will meet many people of my age and older who confuse the two. Life is difficult and complicated and beyond anyone's total control, and the humility to know that will enable you to survive its vicissitudes.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.88},{"text":"knowledge","start":0.88,"end":1.22},{"text":"that","start":1.22,"end":1.46},{"text":"you","start":1.46,"end":1.64},{"text":"have","start":1.64,"end":1.76},{"text":"emerged","start":1.76,"end":2.18},{"text":"wiser","start":2.18,"end":2.54},{"text":"and","start":2.54,"end":2.8},{"text":"stronger","start":2.8,"end":3.18},{"text":"from","start":3.18,"end":3.42},{"text":"setbacks","start":3.42,"end":3.86},{"text":"means","start":3.86,"end":4.5},{"text":"that","start":4.5,"end":4.72},{"text":"you","start":4.72,"end":4.86},{"text":"are","start":4.86,"end":5.16,"punct":","},{"text":"ever","start":5.32,"end":5.5},{"text":"after","start":5.5,"end":5.98,"punct":","},{"text":"secure","start":6.6,"end":6.98},{"text":"in","start":6.98,"end":7.32},{"text":"your","start":7.32,"end":7.48},{"text":"ability","start":7.48,"end":7.78},{"text":"to","start":7.78,"end":8.14},{"text":"survive","start":8.14,"end":8.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"You","start":9.66,"end":9.94},{"text":"will","start":9.94,"end":10.08},{"text":"never","start":10.08,"end":10.34},{"text":"truly","start":10.34,"end":10.68},{"text":"know","start":10.68,"end":10.96},{